<main id="main">
<section class="ihero"><div class="ihero-text"><div class="ihero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">›</span><a href="/appraisal-tools/">Tools</a><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">›</span><span aria-current="page">Appraisal File Checkup</span></nav><p class="kicker">Free checklist</p><h1>Appraisal Readiness Checklist: Score Your Claim File</h1><p class="lede">A strong file makes a stronger appraisal. Answer twelve questions to see how ready you are and what to gather before invoking the appraisal clause.</p></div></div><figure class="ihero-photo"><img src="/assets/img/photos/clipboard.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/clipboard-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/clipboard.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:900px) 100vw, 55vw" width="1200" height="797" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></figure></section>
<section class="sec tool-sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="rv-off">
<div class="calc wide" data-tool="ready">
  <div class="calc-bar"><span>Appraisal file checkup</span><em>12 questions · about two minutes</em></div>
  <div class="calc-grid">
    <div class="calc-in">
      <ol class="quiz"><li data-w="3" data-fix="Get written confirmation that coverage is accepted. If the claim was denied, talk to an Alaska attorney before considering appraisal."><span>Has the insurer accepted coverage for at least part of the loss?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="3" data-fix="Ask in writing for the full line-item estimate, not just the summary page."><span>Do you have the carrier's complete, itemized estimate?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="3" data-fix="Get a line-item estimate from a contractor or estimator. A lump-sum bid is hard to defend before a panel."><span>Do you have your own itemized estimate?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Collect every photo and note when each was taken. If snow or ice was involved, include photos showing depth and conditions."><span>Do you have dated photos from soon after the loss?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Find the Appraisal paragraph in the policy conditions and note any deadlines for naming an appraiser."><span>Have you read the appraisal clause in your policy?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Find the Suit Against Us clause and put the date on your calendar. The timeline planner can help."><span>Do you know your policy's suit-limitation date?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Keep every receipt for tarps, heaters, snow removal, drying equipment and board-up."><span>Did you protect the property and keep receipts?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Make sure attics, wet walls, crawlspaces and framing have been checked so the scope is complete."><span>Has hidden damage been opened up and documented?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Get written quotes for barge or air freight and crew travel. These costs are often left out."><span>If the property is remote, do you have freight or travel quotes?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="1" data-fix="Download or request your declarations page, including any endorsements such as earthquake coverage."><span>Do you have your current declarations page?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="1" data-fix="Gather letters, emails and claim notes in date order."><span>Is your correspondence with the carrier organized by date?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li><li data-w="2" data-fix="Run the numbers in the gap and fee estimator. A small gap may not justify appraisal costs."><span>Is the gap more than roughly 10% or $5,000?</span><span class="yn"><button type="button" class="yes" aria-pressed="false">Yes</button><button type="button" class="no" aria-pressed="false">No</button></span></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="btn-row"><button type="button" class="btn ghost small" data-reset>Reset answers</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="calc-out score" aria-live="polite">
      <div class="meter"><div class="meter-ring" data-o="ring"><span data-o="score">–</span></div><p class="hint">Answered <span data-o="count">0 / 12</span></p></div>
      <div>
        <p class="msg" data-o="verdict"></p>
        <p class="todo-h">Your to-do list</p>
        <ul class="todo" data-o="todo"></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></div><p class="hint center">For planning only. Results depend on what you enter and on your policy, and are not a quote, an appraisal or legal advice.</p><noscript><p class="note">This calculator needs JavaScript. You can still call us at (844) 537-1427 and we’ll run the numbers with you.</p></noscript></div></section>
<div class="wrap two-col"><article class="prose">
<h2>Why preparation matters</h2>
<p>An appraisal award is binding on the amount of loss. Anything missing from your documentation when the panel decides may be gone for good. Preparing first means the panel sees the full scope.</p>
<h2>What the score means</h2>
<p>Each question is weighted by how much it typically affects an appraisal. A high score means you have the core pieces. A low score means appraisal now could lock in a low number. The to-do list shows what to work on first.</p>
<h2>Alaska-specific items</h2>
<p>Two questions reflect Alaska conditions: documenting snow and ice when weather was involved, and getting freight and travel quotes for remote properties. Both are commonly missing from carrier estimates.</p>
<h2>Questions about this tool</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Do I need a perfect score?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>No. It is a guide. Some items may not apply to your claim.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is anything I enter saved?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>No. Answers stay in your browser.</p></div></details></div><h2>More free tools</h2><div class="rel-grid"><a class="rel" href="/appraisal-tools/appraisal-gap-fee-estimator/"><small>Calculator</small><span>Appraisal Gap &amp; Fee Estimator</span><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="rel" href="/appraisal-tools/depreciation-holdback-worksheet/"><small>Worksheet</small><span>RCV/ACV Depreciation Worksheet</span><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="rel" href="/appraisal-tools/roof-area-pitch-calculator/"><small>Calculator</small><span>Roof Area &amp; Pitch Calculator</span><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></article><aside class="side"><div class="side-stick"><div class="side-box call"><h2 class="side-h">Talk it through</h2><p>Free first conversation. We’ll tell you honestly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="side-phone" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn gold block" href="/contact-an-appraiser/">Send claim details</a><small>Mon–Fri 8am–6pm Alaska Time</small></div><div class="side-box"><h2 class="side-h">All claim tools</h2><ul class="side-li